<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="HTML Learning Project - Learn the Building Blocks of the Web">
    <title>HTML Learning Project</title>

    <!-- Bootstrap 5 CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Bootstrap Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .hero-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d6efd 0%, #0a58ca 60%, #0dcaf0 100%);
        }
        pre {
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            color: #d4d4d4;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            padding: 1.25rem;
        }
        code {
            color: #d63384;
        }
        pre code {
            color: inherit;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">

    <header class="hero-header text-white text-center py-5 shadow-sm">
        <div class="container py-3">
            <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-2">🌐 HTML Learning Project</h1>
            <p class="lead mb-0 opacity-90">Master the Building Blocks of the Web</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container my-5 flex-grow-1" style="max-width: 960px;">

        <!-- Section 1: What is HTML -->
        <section id="what-is-html" class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4 p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
            <h2 class="h3 text-primary fw-bold mb-3">🚀 What is HTML?</h2>

            <p class="fs-5">
                <strong>HTML (HyperText Markup Language)</strong> is the standard
                markup language for creating web pages. Think of it as the
                skeleton or foundation of every website you visit.
            </p>

            <blockquote class="blockquote bg-light p-3 border-start border-primary border-4 rounded-end my-4">
                <p class="fw-bold mb-2">Key Points:</p>
                <ul class="mb-0 fs-6">
                    <li><strong>HyperText:</strong> Text with links to other texts.</li>
                    <li><strong>Markup:</strong> A way to annotate text to show structure and meaning.</li>
                    <li><strong>Language:</strong> A set of rules and syntax for creating web content.</li>
                </ul>
            </blockquote>

            <h3 class="h4 text-secondary mt-3 mb-3">🏗️ How HTML Works</h3>

            <p>
                HTML uses <strong>tags</strong> to define elements.
                Tags are keywords surrounded by angle brackets like
                <code>&lt;tagname&gt;</code>.
                Most tags come in pairs:
            </p>

            <pre class="shadow-sm"><code>&lt;tagname&gt;Content goes here&lt;/tagname&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;This is a heading&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a paragraph&lt;/p&gt;</code></pre>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2: Basic Structure -->
        <section id="basic-structure" class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4 p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
            <h2 class="h3 text-primary fw-bold mb-3">📋 Basic HTML Structure</h2>

            <p class="fs-5">Every HTML document follows this basic structure:</p>

            <pre class="shadow-sm"><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"&gt;
    &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;Page Title&lt;/title&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;h1&gt;Welcome to My Website&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;This is my first paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>

            <h3 class="h4 text-secondary mt-3 mb-3">Structure Breakdown</h3>

            <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</strong> — Tells the browser this is HTML5.</li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>&lt;html&gt;</strong> — Root element of the page.</li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>&lt;head&gt;</strong> — Contains metadata that is not directly visible on the page.</li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>&lt;body&gt;</strong> — Contains the visible content of the webpage.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3: Essential Tags -->
        <section id="essential-tags" class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4 p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
            <h2 class="h3 text-primary fw-bold mb-3">🏷️ Essential HTML Tags</h2>

            <div class="table-responsive my-3">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-striped table-hover align-middle">
                    <thead class="table-primary">
                        <tr>
                            <th>Tag</th>
                            <th>Purpose</th>
                            <th>Example</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> - <code>&lt;h6&gt;</code></td>
                            <td>Headings (largest to smallest)</td>
                            <td><code>&lt;h1&gt;Main Title&lt;/h1&gt;</code></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></td>
                            <td>Paragraphs</td>
                            <td><code>&lt;p&gt;This is text&lt;/p&gt;</code></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>&lt;a&gt;</code></td>
                            <td>Links</td>
                            <td><code>&lt;a href="url"&gt;Link text&lt;/a&gt;</code></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code></td>
                            <td>Images</td>
                            <td><code>&lt;img src="image.jpg" alt="Description"&gt;</code></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>&lt;div&gt;</code></td>
                            <td>Container or section</td>
                            <td><code>&lt;div&gt;Content here&lt;/div&gt;</code></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>&lt;ul&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;li&gt;</code></td>
                            <td>Lists</td>
                            <td><code>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Item&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</code></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <h3 class="h4 text-secondary mt-4 mb-3">🎯 Live Examples</h3>

            <div class="p-4 bg-light rounded-3 border mb-3">
                <h1 class="display-6">This is an H1 heading</h1>
                <h2 class="h3">This is an H2 heading</h2>
                <h3 class="h4 text-muted">This is an H3 heading</h3>

                <p class="mt-3">
                    This is a paragraph with
                    <strong>bold text</strong> and
                    <em>italic text</em>.
                </p>

                <p>Here's a <a href="#" class="text-decoration-underline">sample link</a>.</p>

                <div class="row mt-4">
                    <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                        <h4 class="h5 fw-bold">Unordered List</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li>First item</li>
                            <li>Second item</li>
                            <li>Third item</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                        <h4 class="h5 fw-bold">Ordered List</h4>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Step one</li>
                            <li>Step two</li>
                            <li>Step three</li>
                        </ol>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4: Forms -->
        <section id="forms" class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4 p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
            <h2 class="h3 text-primary fw-bold mb-3">📝 HTML Forms</h2>

            <p>Forms allow users to input data.</p>

            <pre class="shadow-sm"><code>&lt;form&gt;
    &lt;label for="name"&gt;Name:&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;input type="text" id="name" name="name"&gt;

    &lt;label for="email"&gt;Email:&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;input type="email" id="email" name="email"&gt;

    &lt;label for="message"&gt;Message:&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;textarea id="message" name="message"&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;

    &lt;button type="submit"&gt;Submit&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/form&gt;</code></pre>

            <h3 class="h4 text-secondary mt-4 mb-3">Example Form</h3>

            <form class="bg-light p-4 rounded-3 border shadow-sm">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="name" class="form-label fw-bold">Name:</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Masukkan nama Anda">
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="email" class="form-label fw-bold">Email:</label>
                    <input type="email" class="form-control" id="email" name="email" placeholder="nama@example.com">
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="subject" class="form-label fw-bold">Subject:</label>
                    <select class="form-select" id="subject" name="subject">
                        <option value="question">Question</option>
                        <option value="feedback">Feedback</option>
                        <option value="support">Support</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="message" class="form-label fw-bold">Message:</label>
                    <textarea class="form-control" id="message" name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Tuliskan pesan Anda..."></textarea>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary px-4 py-2 fw-semibold">Submit Form</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5: Attributes -->
        <section id="attributes" class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4 p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
            <h2 class="h3 text-primary fw-bold mb-3">🎨 HTML Attributes</h2>

            <p>Attributes provide additional information about HTML elements.</p>

            <pre class="shadow-sm"><code>&lt;!-- Common attributes --&gt;

&lt;img
    src="photo.jpg"
    alt="A beautiful sunset"
    width="300"
    height="200"
&gt;

&lt;a
    href="https://example.com"
    target="_blank"
    title="Visit Example"
&gt;
    Click here
&lt;/a&gt;

&lt;div
    class="container"
    id="main-content"
    style="color: blue;"
&gt;
    Content
&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>

            <h3 class="h4 text-secondary mt-4 mb-3">Important Attributes</h3>

            <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>id</strong> — Unique identifier for an element.</li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>class</strong> — Groups elements for styling.</li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>src</strong> — Source file for images, videos, etc.</li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>href</strong> — URL for links.</li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>alt</strong> — Alternative text for images.</li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>style</strong> — Inline CSS styling.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 6: Tables -->
        <section id="tables" class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4 p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
            <h2 class="h3 text-primary fw-bold mb-3">📊 Tables in HTML</h2>

            <p>Tables organize data in rows and columns.</p>

            <pre class="shadow-sm"><code>&lt;table&gt;
    &lt;thead&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;th&gt;Name&lt;/th&gt;
            &lt;th&gt;Age&lt;/th&gt;
            &lt;th&gt;City&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/thead&gt;
    &lt;tbody&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;John&lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;25&lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;New York&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</code></pre>

            <h3 class="h4 text-secondary mt-4 mb-3">Sample Table</h3>

            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="table table-striped table-hover border align-middle">
                    <thead class="table-primary">
                        <tr>
                            <th>Student</th>
                            <th>Subject</th>
                            <th>Grade</th>
                            <th>Status</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Alice Johnson</td>
                            <td>Mathematics</td>
                            <td>A+</td>
                            <td><span class="badge bg-success">Passed</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Bob Smith</td>
                            <td>Physics</td>
                            <td>B</td>
                            <td><span class="badge bg-success">Passed</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Carol Davis</td>
                            <td>Chemistry</td>
                            <td>A</td>
                            <td><span class="badge bg-success">Passed</span></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 7: Practice -->
        <section id="practice" class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4 p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
            <h2 class="h3 text-primary fw-bold mb-3">💻 Practice Exercises</h2>

            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border h-100">
                        <h3 class="h5 text-secondary fw-bold mb-3">Beginner Tasks</h3>
                        <ol class="mb-0">
                            <li>Create a basic HTML page with a title, heading, and paragraph.</li>
                            <li>Add an image with alt text.</li>
                            <li>Create a list of your favorite movies.</li>
                            <li>Build a simple table with your weekly schedule.</li>
                        </ol>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border h-100">
                        <h3 class="h5 text-secondary fw-bold mb-3">Intermediate Tasks</h3>
                        <ol class="mb-0">
                            <li>Create a contact form with different input types.</li>
                            <li>Build a navigation menu with links.</li>
                            <li>Design a simple blog post layout.</li>
                            <li>Create a photo gallery grid.</li>
                        </ol>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 8: Project Structure -->
        <section id="project-structure" class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4 p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
            <h2 class="h3 text-primary fw-bold mb-3">🗂️ Project Structure</h2>

            <p>Here's how to organize your HTML project:</p>

            <pre class="shadow-sm"><code>my-website/
│
├── index.html
├── about.html
├── contact.html
│
├── css/
│   └── styles.css
│
├── js/
│   └── script.js
│
└── images/
    ├── logo.png
    ├── hero-image.jpg
    └── gallery/
        ├── photo1.jpg
        └── photo2.jpg</code></pre>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 9: Next Steps -->
        <section id="next-steps" class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4 p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
            <h2 class="h3 text-primary fw-bold mb-3">🎯 Next Steps in Your Learning Journey</h2>
            <p>Setelah menguasai dasar-dasar HTML, Anda dapat melanjutkan ke topik berikut untuk mengembangkan keahlian web development Anda:</p>
            <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>CSS (Cascading Style Sheets)</strong> — Mempelajari layout, Flexbox, Grid, dan styling lanjutan.</li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>JavaScript</strong> — Menambahkan interaktivitas dan logika pada halaman web Anda.</li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><strong>Responsive Web Design</strong> — Memastikan tampilan web optimal di perangkat mobile dan desktop.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

    </main>

